# Single source for the Crossplane CLI + core versions this repo renders with.
#
# It exists because the same three numbers used to live in four places —
# CLAUDE.md prose, .github/workflows/render-golden.yaml, tests/render/*.sh and
# Taskfile.yaml — and nothing kept them in step. Sourced (never executed) by:
#
#   tests/render/crossplane-version.sh    the guard both golden scripts run
#   .github/workflows/render-golden.yaml  installs CROSSPLANE_VERSION
#   Taskfile.yaml (render, render-golden)  --crossplane-image default
#
# Plain `KEY=value` lines only. bash sources this on the runner and mvdan/sh
# (what go-task actually runs) sources it in the Taskfile, so: no arrays, no
# command substitution, no `export`, no bashisms.

# The floor, and the reason this file exists at all. An older CLI does not fail
# — it renders XRs WITHOUT spec.crossplane.resourceRefs, so regenerating the
# goldens with one deletes that block from every snapshot and the diff reads
# like a tidy-up (106 files, -2513 lines, all boilerplate a reviewer skims).
# v2.3.0 is also where `beta validate`/`beta trace` became
# `resource validate`/`resource trace`, the spelling this repo's docs and
# Taskfile use. See #393 and #349.
CROSSPLANE_MIN_VERSION=v2.3.0

# What CI installs, and therefore the CLI the committed goldens were rendered
# with. `sthings.baseos` ships the same version, so a workstation that follows
# the fleet matches CI without extra work.
CROSSPLANE_VERSION=v2.4.1

# The core image `crossplane render` runs `crossplane internal render` in, from
# CLI v2.3.0 on. Unpinned it defaults to the FLOATING tag crossplane:stable,
# which lags and breaks render without warning (stuttgart-things/dagger#295) —
# a floating tag in the execution path is the same hazard as one in a package
# pin. Must match the core the dagger verify module pins, or verify and these
# goldens render through two different renderers and the snapshots drift
# against the check that produced them.
CROSSPLANE_RENDER_IMAGE=xpkg.crossplane.io/crossplane/crossplane:v2.4.0
